                        The processor uses original CRM ID when supplied; otherwise it uses captured Contact, then Lead. It prefers a resolved Contact, including a converted Lead&#x27;s ConvertedContactId, for WhoId/Note links. It does not rerun an email search for a later-created person.
                    </p>
