                        The queue owns the Task, rather than the Contact owner. Confirm the queue supports Tasks and intended members can claim/work them. Queue assignment alone does not send a notification or implement an SLA. Task Description accepts 32000 characters while Submission Details can store 32768; oversized Task inputs are not silently truncated and require correction.
