                    <h2 id="enhanced-note-content-and-relationships">
                        Enhanced Note content and relationships
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        Each successfully processed submission creates <strong>one enhanced Note (<code>ContentNote</code>)</strong> titled with Asset Name. It includes the submission number, asset, Submitted At, Captured At (CreatedDate), submitted email, original CRM ID, resolved CRM record, optional follow-up Task ID and Submission Details. A blank source timestamp is not replaced with a fabricated source date; capture time is separately labeled.
