                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        Another asset uses an existing process
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        Reuse capture with its own assetName and stable assetKey. Add approved processor configuration keyed by asset/source/business unit when different behavior is needed.
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        Different queue, priority, campaign, or follow-up SLA
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        Store approved routing settings in Custom Metadata and have the processor resolve them. Use stable developer names or portable configuration rather than embedding sandbox record IDs.
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        A genuinely new business process
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        Add an explicitly selected subflow or Flow branch with a defined input/output contract. Test it separately and invoke it from the dispatcher.
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        New answers needed for decisions or reporting
                                    </td>
